{"id":"http.cookiejar/DefaultCookiePolicy.rfc2109_as_netscape","module":"http.cookiejar","qualname":"DefaultCookiePolicy.rfc2109_as_netscape","name":"rfc2109_as_netscape","kind":"attribute","parent":"http.cookiejar/DefaultCookiePolicy","signatures":[],"doc":"If true, request that the CookieJar instance downgrade RFC 2109 cookies (that is, cookies received in a Set-Cookie header with a version cookie-attribute of 1) to Netscape cookies by setting the version attribute of the Cookie instance to 0. The default value is None, in which case RFC 2109 cookies are downgraded if and only if RFC 2965 handling is turned off. Therefore, RFC 2109 cookies are downgraded by default.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/http.cookiejar.html#http.cookiejar.DefaultCookiePolicy.rfc2109_as_netscape","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
